@host = http://localhost:5120

### The internal price door - called DIRECT at the service; the gateway has no /internal route
POST {{host}}/internal/prices
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productIds": ["01a0cede-06cd-7606-90ab-ab99a9608f1d", "01a0cede-06cd-7e01-a117-1cef7ed7b644"] }


### Ask for an unknown id - it is simply absent from the answer; the CALLER decides if that is an error
POST {{host}}/internal/prices
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productIds": ["00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"] }
